{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16206190","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16206190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1620619001:0":{"text":"唉……这位老师的经历真够坎坷的。","source_cn":"唉……这位老师的经历真够坎坷的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29FBFEA6E250073C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620619002:0":{"text":"也许他只是想让学生有个好未来，只是……方法粗暴了点。","source_cn":"也许他只是想让学生有个好未来，只是……方法粗暴了点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DEACBFE60F3C60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620619003:0":{"text":"粗暴？为什么你们会这么觉得？","source_cn":"粗暴？为什么你们会这么觉得？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46DA6BA1A2DEABD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620619004:0":{"text":"当然啊，就连他自己，不也这么承认了吗？","source_cn":"当然啊，就连他自己，不也这么承认了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBADB8DE630D244FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620619005:0":{"text":"我不太明白。难道督促学生，不正是老师的职责吗？","source_cn":"我不太明白。难道督促学生，不正是老师的职责吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204FF192A170A017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620619006:0":{"text":"啧啧，洛兰，其实我一直想问——你是为了什么才想当魔法师的？","source_cn":"啧啧，洛兰，其实我一直想问——你是为了什么才想当魔法师的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x220B7523DC6043F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620619007:0":{"text":"为了什么……？","source_cn":"为了什么……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F98720DC0FD3E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620619008:0":{"text":"当然得有个理由吧，就像饿了会吃饭，渴了会喝水一样。","source_cn":"当然得有个理由吧，就像饿了会吃饭，渴了会喝水一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E7BB0163064C08F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620619009:0":{"text":"我……这个……","source_cn":"我……这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x555A168346EFE0C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620619010:0":{"text":"比如说，我的魔法启蒙，是镇上的一位魔法师老奶奶教的。","source_cn":"比如说，我的魔法启蒙，是镇上的一位魔法师老奶奶教的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3884072F8B63CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620619011:0":{"text":"那会儿我们镇老是闹旱灾，她的魔法总能带来温润的小雨，救活庄稼。","source_cn":"那会儿我们镇老是闹旱灾，她的魔法总能带来温润的小雨，救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC01E7D29A08EFCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620619012:0":{"text":"让我真正对魔法燃起兴趣的，是她对我说的——<style=\"highlight\">“魔法只是工具，点燃希望的薪，传递希望的种。”</style>","source_cn":"让我真正对魔法燃起兴趣的，是她对我说的——<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA01D924FFAB8CDFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620619013:0":{"text":"就因为这句话，我才一直坚持学水魔法，希望有一天能像她那样，独挡一面。","source_cn":"就因为这句话，我才一直坚持学水魔法，希望有一天能像她那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E03BE7E448CE5A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620619014:0":{"text":"所以学术对我来说是为了实现目标而存在的，不然就是本末倒置。","source_cn":"所以学术对我来说是为了实现目标而存在的，不然就是本末倒置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB827AE135FBD9ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620619015:0":{"text":"我从未想过这些……我只是喜欢研究学术，从没想过要用它干什么。","source_cn":"我从未想过这些……我只是喜欢研究学术，从没想过要用它干什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5876401CBB768658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620619016:0":{"text":"洛兰话音未落，楼道深处忽然传来一阵急促的扑翼声。","source_cn":"洛兰话音未落，楼道深处忽然传来一阵急促的扑翼声。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB61EEAF294BC9158","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"洛兰话音未落，楼道深处忽然传来一阵急促的扑翼声。","female":"洛兰话音未落，楼道深处忽然传来一阵急促的扑翼声。","variant_male_record_index":"213803","variant_female_record_index":"213804","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620619017:0":{"text":"无数魔法书从阴影中冲出，像潮水般扑向你们——","source_cn":"无数魔法书从阴影中冲出，像潮水般扑向你们——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A942FDF15CACB4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"无数魔法书从阴影中冲出，像潮水般扑向你们——","female":"无数魔法书从阴影中冲出，像潮水般扑向你们——","variant_male_record_index":"213805","variant_female_record_index":"213806","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620619018:0":{"text":"一大群魔法书！它们发疯了！","source_cn":"一大群魔法书！它们发疯了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD58E5468C9EE3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:班克西":{"text":"班克西","source":"班克西","status":"source"},"speaker:洛兰":{"text":"洛兰","source":"洛兰","status":"source"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}